class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>当<span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>越<span class=\"color-value\"></span>过<span class=\"color-value\"></span>巨<span class=\"color-value\"></span>浪<span class=\"color-value\"></span>与<span class=\"color-value\"></span>大<span class=\"color-value\"></span>雨<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 192304</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一地的棕榈树皮，一捆扎好的罗盘草，一罐密封好的动物油脂，一筐洗净的洁白贝壳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一架吹出海风的手工风车，一盒火炙礁石研磨而成的颜料，一个努库泰澳人，一个在海浪间巡回的乐手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310812.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-310812.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310812.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310812.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-310812.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310812.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/HeadIconSmall-310812.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310812.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>图图石子，你看！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她将一张树皮遮住自己的脸，透过上面的两个洞口眨眨自己的眼睛，像发现了新奇事物的小孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310914.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-310914.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310914.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310914.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-310914.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310914.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-310914.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310914.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>我也有一个……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>图图石子找到另外一张树皮，举到面前，透过仅有的洞口露出嘴巴，开始说话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"631020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-631020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-631020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"631020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-631020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-631020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-631020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-631020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>我来自森林，我是一个……德鲁伊？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个刚刚接触的陌生故事、一个陌生的名词，以及生涩的发音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>你看那些书了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>塞洛尼告诉我，那些书很有趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>我还在认字，所以看得不是很快……上面讲了很多我从来没有听说过的事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>你已经做得很好了，图图石子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她按照图图石子的指示，将手中的罗盘草拆散，一根一根浸到油脂里去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>它闻起来有一种……很特别的味道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>罗盘草的用途很多，它本身是一种药草，可以治疗腹痛，消炎，祛疣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>轮船来到努库泰澳之前，罗盘草治愈了许多努库泰澳人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>后来我们从外乡人手里换来了一些药片，努库泰澳的老人不愿意接受，说它们是“魔鬼的毒药”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>他们只信任岛上的药草。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>但是……只有罗盘草，也无法治愈一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>作为一位在海上巡游的乐手，她深知医疗的重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>对于努库泰澳人来说，忍耐是一种美德。在出海的时候生病，没有岸可以停靠，努库泰澳人不能停下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>我们要越过暴雨和巨浪，抛网，捕捞，满载而归。受伤也一定要做到，等你回到小岛上，家乡和族人会治愈你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>图图石子……你也这样过吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>有一次我们出海，遇到了雷暴，当时整个天都变成了暗红色，闪电像天空的一道道裂缝……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_at_haimian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_at_haimian\"><img alt=\"2_7_at_haimian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/Cg-2_7_at_haimian.png/600px-Cg-2_7_at_haimian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/Cg-2_7_at_haimian.png/900px-Cg-2_7_at_haimian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/Cg-2_7_at_haimian.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_at_haimian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-310901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-310901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-310901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>所有人都被雨浇透了，船头高高竖起，我们紧紧扒住船舷，不让自己掉到海里去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这样险象环生的海上冒险让乐手小姐张大了嘴巴，她对海洋的见识颇多，足以想象当时的凶险。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye3.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_bg_youlun_ye3\"><img alt=\"2_4_bg_youlun_ye3\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye3.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye3.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye3.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-310912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-310912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-310912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>我听见闪电把船上的木箱劈开了，露兜树果和红鲷鱼全都滚到海里去了，那是最惊险的一次出海。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310813.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-310813.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310813.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310813.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-310813.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310813.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/HeadIconSmall-310813.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310813.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>天哪！你们是怎么回来的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310918.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-310918.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310918.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310918.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-310918.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310918.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-310918.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310918.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>闭上眼睛，直到穿过雷暴。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-310901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-310901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-310901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>当时我们每个人身上都带着燃烧过的罗盘草根，它可以帮我们避开闪电。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>芭卡洛儿用手摩挲着手中的罗盘草，它的根部弯弯曲曲，有种柔软又干燥的质感。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>在出海之前，我们都请示过贝壳的指引，它告诉我们，这次出海我们会平安归来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>贝壳的指引不会明示过程，只会告诉我们结果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>回到岛上之后，我把那些罗盘草根拿出来，它们都变成了黑乎乎的灰，被风吹走了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>哇……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>如果只是这样看着它们，我绝对想象不出它们会那么神奇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>罗盘草……罗盘草。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她从芭卡洛儿的手中分出一根，罗盘草因缺水而变得蜷曲，叶片也失去了光泽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>其实罗盘草的效用和种植它的方法有关，努库泰澳有好多种罗盘草。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongxiuqichu_zhou\"><img alt=\"linzhongxiuqichu_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/600px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/900px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310914.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-310914.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310914.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310914.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-310914.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310914.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-310914.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310914.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>罗盘灼灼用的罗盘草是最普遍的，要把它种在有日晒的地方，它吸收了日光，在黑暗中亮起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310914.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-310914.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310914.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310914.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-310914.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310914.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-310914.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310914.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>当出海的努库泰澳人归来时，罗盘灼灼指引着我们岛的方向。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310914.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-310914.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310914.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310914.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-310914.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310914.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-310914.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310914.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>躲避闪电的罗盘草要种在高处，它要真正见过闪电，才知道如何应对它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310914.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-310914.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310914.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310914.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-310914.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310914.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-310914.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310914.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>我们会爬上小岛最高的悬崖，把种子撒在上面。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_bg_hean.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_bg_hean\"><img alt=\"2_2_bg_hean\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/Cg-2_2_bg_hean.png/600px-Cg-2_2_bg_hean.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/Cg-2_2_bg_hean.png/900px-Cg-2_2_bg_hean.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/Cg-2_2_bg_hean.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_bg_hean.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_zhou\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/Cg-1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_zhou.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/Cg-1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_zhou.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/Cg-1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_chuandaozhezhiting_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310918.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-310918.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310918.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310918.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-310918.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310918.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-310918.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310918.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>药用的罗盘草，有的长在海岸线附近，有的和果树共生，有的要完全种进海水里。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>细数着种植方法，她的声音却渐渐低了下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>这些……是最后的罗盘草了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>最后的……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>对，努库泰澳最后的罗盘草，以后我们不用种植，也不用采摘它们了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一向最稳的手，捧着这即将消逝之物，也不禁颤了一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>图图石子，可以吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>用它来做罗盘灼灼，为了点亮箱庭贸易节……真的可以吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>当然可以。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>图图石子露出一个笑容，但那好像不代表着释怀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>我和塞洛尼，还有其他努库泰澳人，他们都赞成这样做。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>司辰小姐，箱子里的朋友，基金会的人，大家帮助了我们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>我们想这么做，我们应该这么做……罗盘草点亮罗盘灼灼，这是它最好的归宿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>如果只是捆着它们，把它们放在角落，它们就只是普通的草，而不是努库泰澳的罗盘草了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>可是，可是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但图图石子说的话又是那样正确。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>芭卡洛儿小姐，罗盘灼灼会照亮你演奏的地方，我很高兴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>我们一起把它完成，好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">图图石子：</div><div>就像在船上那样。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TSW-04"}}